From: NWA50BE OpenWrt Project <noreply@invalid.example>
Subject: [PATCH] uhttpd: update past realm bypass and ubus list fixes
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

Update uhttpd to the 2026-10-19 revision selected by OpenWrt main
20c44f41b2ba. It adds 3aa7e1c7678 (GHSA-5cgm-8h9x-v28c, Basic Auth realms
for URL-prefix handlers) and 64dcf47aa7f8, which rejects non-string ubus
"list" params that caused a pre-auth out-of-bounds read.

---
 package/network/services/uhttpd/Makefile | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/package/network/services/uhttpd/Makefile b/package/network/services/uhttpd/Makefile
index 11bad77..f01eea7 100644
--- a/package/network/services/uhttpd/Makefile
+++ b/package/network/services/uhttpd/Makefile
@@ -12,9 +12,9 @@ PKG_RELEASE:=1
 
 PKG_SOURCE_PROTO:=git
 PKG_SOURCE_URL=$(PROJECT_GIT)/project/uhttpd.git
-PKG_SOURCE_DATE:=2026-08-03
-PKG_SOURCE_VERSION:=60f64bec40c8113cf09815ec377761b1f4f95f22
-PKG_MIRROR_HASH:=702b8df1ba868db13ae93b28ddaa9c421bcbfa34e8633cae984029e7b50ec59f
+PKG_SOURCE_DATE:=2026-10-19
+PKG_SOURCE_VERSION:=ca796d7dec5697a2d1a7a42be79677f239b64282
+PKG_MIRROR_HASH:=6a2fbcc0dbd3f6c9d076037f23b8544356487aea6b00d2a82a3591b09ba4a8e4
 PKG_MAINTAINER:=Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
 PKG_LICENSE:=ISC
 
-- 
